WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
The fastest gun in the West had one

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:06.080
rule, never draw first. Imagine you're

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:08.320
standing in the street at noon staring

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:10.000
down a guy everyone calls Slow Eddie.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.790
His hands are at his sides, he hasn't

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.520
even looked at his gun, and he just nods

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:15.240
[music] at you and says, "After you."

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.080
So, you grab for your gun faster than

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.720
you've ever moved in your life. Yet,

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:20.120
you're face down in the dirt before it

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:22.360
clears the holster. How is that

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.120
possible? Eddie isn't even fast. He'd

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:26.280
lose a race to the saloon against a guy

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:28.400
carrying two beers. But, men ride in

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.760
from three states away to duel him, and

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.880
every one [music] of them goes down the

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:33.920
exact same way. The only weird thing

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.680
anyone ever notices is that Eddie never

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:37.600
looks at your face. He just stares at

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:39.400
your hand. You see, think about the last

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.080
time your phone slid off a table. You

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.920
caught it before you even realized it

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:44.800
was falling because you never decided to

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:46.800
catch it, your body just did. But, when

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:49.040
you went for your gun, you had to decide

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:51.080
the exact moment to draw, and that tiny

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:53.160
decision slowed your hand down. Eddie

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:54.640
never decides anything. He just waits

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:58.080
for your hand to twitch and lets his

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:58.080
body react [music] on its own.

